# Copy this file to .env.local (ignored by git) and fill it in.
#
# The TMDB credential of the app itself: the "API Read Access Token" from
# https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api. The build puts it in the main
# process, so whoever uses the app does not have to create a key.
# Without it the app still works, but asks each user for a key of their own.
TMDB_READ_TOKEN=
